<title>USA: Parallel Petroleum Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Parallel Petroleum Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MIDLAND, Texas 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended March 31:		 1997	    1996</p>
<p> Revenues				     4,040,647     2,337,924</p>
<p> Net income				   1,264,747	 565,983</p>
<p> Per share					    .07	     .04</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding  18,183,450   15,430,648</p>
<p>Net cash flow provided by operating</p>
<p>activities before working capital</p>
<p>  adjustments				 2,848,928     1,511,380</p>
<p> Per share					    .16	     .10</p>
<p>NOTE: The full name is Parallel Petroleum Corp.</p>
